{"id":"n52276-1-7","stage":3,"title":"레몬 · 柠檬","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52276-1-7-1","ko":"커피를 드시겠어요? 아니면 홍차로 하시겠어요?","zh":"您要咖啡还是红茶？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피를","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피를","audio":"/audio/5f07afae7adf3e91d8be.mp3"}},{"text":"드시겠어요?","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드시겠어요","audio":"/audio/bd87666483297d02079d.mp3"}},{"text":"아니면","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"아니면","audio":"/audio/8d84741c74792056752a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니면","audio":"/audio/8d84741c74792056752a.mp3"}},{"text":"홍차로","meaning":"红茶","explanation":"홍차：红茶；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"홍차","audio":"/audio/9113b05332a2b45d69bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87573","senseId":"1","lemma":"홍차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"홍차로","audio":"/audio/bbc998a213848545a94e.mp3"}},{"text":"하시겠어요?","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하시겠어요","audio":"/audio/8bf2baddb61acd48d4b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"(尊称)吃。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"9113b05332a2b45d","term":"홍차","zh":"红茶","audio":"/audio/9113b05332a2b45d69bf.mp3","entryId":"87573","definition":"把茶树叶发酵烘干制成，用沸水冲泡后呈亮红色的有香味的茶。","pronunciation":["홍차"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进食或抽烟等。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e08df1c401b8e05e9531.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52276-1-7-2","ko":"홍차로 주세요. 저는 신 것을 못 먹으니 레몬은 빼 주시고요.","zh":"请给我红茶。我吃不了酸的，请别放柠檬。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"홍차로","meaning":"红茶","explanation":"홍차：红茶；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"홍차","audio":"/audio/9113b05332a2b45d69bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87573","senseId":"1","lemma":"홍차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"홍차로","audio":"/audio/bbc998a213848545a94e.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"신","meaning":"酸","explanation":"시다：酸；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시다","audio":"/audio/3406141af9dec890e343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66285","senseId":"1","lemma":"시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신","audio":"/audio/e609f3d29b9f741ae96e.mp3"}},{"text":"것을","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것을","audio":"/audio/bce7033cdb84462ff6a7.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으니","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으니","audio":"/audio/27b51cab75cb9eb23f1a.mp3"}},{"text":"레몬은","meaning":"柠檬","explanation":"레몬：柠檬；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"레몬","audio":"/audio/3de26124efdefae54af8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52276","senseId":"1","lemma":"레몬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"레몬은","audio":"/audio/aab1fb7f9e4e1e22a2dc.mp3"}},{"text":"빼","meaning":"减，扣，除","explanation":"빼다：减，扣，除；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"2","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼","audio":"/audio/c5278c9c8f150cd37c05.mp3"}},{"text":"주시고요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；고：省略后续内容而结束句子，常用于回答或委婉的指示；加 요 更礼貌。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주시고요","audio":"/audio/1ff8251ed6a06ab1a864.mp3"